  <book code="EPH" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:33:16 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Ephesians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Ê-phê-sô</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ê-phê-sô</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eph</para>
  <para style="mt">Ê-phê-sô</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Phaau-lô, sưưq-đô ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih tââq karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng, pagơơi đóng nôôq manưih đu huuiq, nek nôôq manưih đu huuiq tơơt dhiq Ê-phê-sô lơq nek nôôq manưih bhơt lóóm kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Rââm ơơn phươk liêm lơq yươq rauha tââq Yaang Pleng, Ama nôôq he, lơq Chuôq, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, tơk dhiq adhi anó.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Đaang bhi haanh Yaang Pleng, Ama ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he, nek Yaang ơi dhaluônh phươk đóng nôôq he palơq dyóp rau phươk liêm lóóm huuiq tââq nôôq dhiq piing Pleng kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />kung kơi Ađó ơi chââih nôôq he kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih tââq kah ơi tavaaih hóng katiêk, đóng nôôq he bâân sek tabah lơq kah dhiq chóóm jươm trêh toom mat Ađó.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Tââq luônh lóóm tanhơr, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Ađó ơi kanóq laloom nôôq he đóng têêng akóón partơơt ưng Ađó tââq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, ting rau bhuui khe ưng kanóq kiêng Ađó, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />đóng ve machak maraang palơq rau bhi haanh cha-iil tabah ưng ơơn phươk liêm Ađó đu Ađó ơi bhươh rông kliim đóng leq nôôq he kalóóng Akóón Bơk Nh'nhơr ưng Ađó; <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />hơq kalóóng Akóón achêk, nôôq he ve rau trôông paq ganơơm ahaam Ađó, rau pei lơơi matu lơt ting rau karvaan kabhôôq ưng ơơn phươk liêm Ađó, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />nek ơơn phươk liêm đu Ađó ơi đóng leq nôôq he kơi xưa raai kalóóng dyóp rau tarbech galang lơq tarlương tabech, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Têêng đóng nôôq he đơơp n'nal rau đu lalââp ưng karnóq kiêng Ađó ting rau iêm lóóm Ađó, nek rau đu Ađó ơi kanóq têêng tââq laloom kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />đóng xók tơk ganah xong bhơt tarnêêng ơi loom praaq, hơq gaboq karong dyóp rau lóóiq kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, dyóp rau dhiq pleng palơq dyóp rau dhiq katiêk, kalóóng Ađó, <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />nek kalóóng Yaang đu nôôq he kung bâân blah phơn drươp karvaan, taai ơi bâân praaq laloom ting karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang têêng tavaaih dyóp tarnêêng dhalam kơi tarnêêng ưng karnóq kiêng Ađó, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />buôn đóng nôôq he, nôôq manưih laloom bhơt tabóq lóóm rââm dhiq Chuôq Paq Manưih, bâân machak maraang palơq rau bhi haanh leq cha-iil tabah ưng Ađó. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Lơq kung kalóóng Ađó, xong xók xâng taruuih ưng paraaq dhalam, nek Taruuih Liêm leq rau trôông paq adhi anó, lơq xók ơi huuiq dhiq Ađó, hơq adhi anó ơi bâân pakanal palơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm ting paraaq hươq; <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />hơq Yaang achêk nek rau jư karnal leq drươp kavaan ưng nôôq he đóng patơk xók pók kơl tabhơt drươp karvaan, đóng machak maraang palơq rau bhi haanh leq cha-iil tabah ưng Ađó.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Taai kơi achêk, patư tââq xók aku xâng leq lóóm huuiq ưng adhi anó kalóóng Chuôq, nek Chuôq Jê-su, lơq lóóm tanhơr pakoom đóng tabhơt nôôq manưih đu huuiq, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />hơq aku kah ha-ơt tapôông paraaq ma-ơơn taai adhi anó, n'tóól tơk adhi anó kalóóng paraaq gavơh nhan ưng ađêi, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />buôn đóng Yaang Pleng ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he, nek Ama cha-iil tabah, e đóng leq adhi anó Yaang Liêm ưng rau tarbech galang lơq rau tapakah kalóóng tarnêêng đơơp n'nal Ađó, <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />têêng kaliêng mat ưng lóóm adhi anó bâân dyóól brương, đóng adhi anó n'nal rau parââm leq rau dhaloong kayua ưng Ađó nek hau rau, rau karvaan kabhôôq ưng drươp karvaan cha-iil tabah Ađó kalóóng nôôq manưih đu huuiq xariêq ng'kơi, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />lơq rau gamak liêm kah lơq babi marchơng ưng mataai raman Ađó nek ng'kơi palơq nôôq he, nek nôôq manưih ve lóóm huuiq, ting rau tarnêêng tââq praan karơ mataai raman ưng Ađó, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />hơq Ađó ơi têêng kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih xók payuur Chuôq Paq Manưih tââq akan chêt mamông lóóiq lơq patơơt tơơt hót atươm Ađó tơơt nôôq dhiq m'piing pleng, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />jalơh changaai m'piing dyóp kataai, têêng kala, praan karơ, lơq kala kataai, palơq dyóp rau dhanóók bâân n'nal tơk achak, eh mưi kalóóng đơơi ađôk hơq bhơt kalóóng đơơi ravang tơk dyơq. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Ađó ơi têêng dyóp rau chakoh dhiq dyung Chuôq Paq Manưih lơq patơơt Chuôq Paq Manưih têêng koq tơơt piing dyóp rau palơq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />hơq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq, nek chak araang Ađó, nek rau bing bhlaai ưng Yaang têêng bing bhlaai dyóp rau kalóóng dyóp n'dreh m'ma.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Leq phơn adhi anó, nek manưih chêt kalóóng nôôq têêng lơt lơq matu lơt ađêi, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />nek kalóóng nôôq rau đu xók n'loom, adhi anó ơi cha tơơt ting paloong hóói ưng manưih hóng katiêk ađôk, ting manưih têêng koq palơq têêng kala dhiq bharyô, nek abhô abhưi xók ađôk dyơq têêng kalóóng nôôq akóón anaaq kah huuiq bhi. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Hơq n'loom ahei, tơơt m'pơng piđó, tabhơt nôôq he kung ơi mamông kalóóng nôôq lóóm malóóch kiêng ưng manưih ti ađêi, têêng nôôq malóóch kiêng ưng manưih ti lơq lóóm karnóq. Ting lóóm karnóq kaxu, nôôq he biêh nek akóón anaaq ưng rau jarnah xarngaat kung kơi dyóp manưih lââng. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Bơơi Yaang Pleng, nek Yaang kavaan lóóm ayô ka-er, taai lóóm nh'nhơr gamak garóóq ưng Ađó hơq Ađó ơi nh'nhơr nôôq he. <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Hơq xók nôôq he nek nôôq manưih chêt kalóóng nôôq têêng lơt ađêi, nek Ađó ơi payuur nôôq he ting mamông kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, ađek nek ve ơơn phươk liêm hơq adhi anó ơi bâân paq jóói. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Ađó payuur nôôq he ting mamông lóóiq, lơq partơơt tơơt madhiq palơq Ađó tơơt nôôq tanơơt dhiq pleng kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq paq manưih, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />đóng kalóóng nôôq klaang manưih ravang tơk, Ađó ve chóóm pakah rau karvaan kabhôôq kah bil ưng ơơn phươk liêm Ađó tââq rau moor dha-iiq palơq nôôq he kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Taai tââq ơơn phươk liêm, adhi anó bâân paq ve lóóm huuiq, rau ađô kah vaaih chat tââq adhi anó, hơq nek kliim kaliim ưng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />eh rau gluh tââq nôôq tarnêêng têêng, đóng kah mưi ngaai ve chóóm laach pajơơr. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Taai nôôq he nek paraaq tarnêêng ưng Ađó, bâân tavaaih payuur kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih đóng nôôq tarnêêng liêm đu Yaang Pleng ơi ravang laloom đóng nôôq he ve chóóm mamông kalóóng nôôq tarnêêng achêk.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Taai kơi ađek, phaai hei kơi n'loom ahei, adhi anó nek dhanuôr katiêk lââng kalóóng manưih ti, dhanuôr bâân tađóók nek “kah ơi đơơp iêt ng'kar” tââq dhanuôr bâân đóók nek “ơi bâân iêt ng'kar” kalóóng manưih ti, mưi charnap taai têi akóón manưih têêng. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Taai xók ađek, adhi anó biêh bâân tablah n'tua palơq Chuôq Paq Manưih, xók bâân lơơi hót nguôi dhanuôr manưih I-sơ-ra-êên, lơq biêh nek tamóói chrih palơq nôôq raket bóóp ưng paraaq hươq, hơq kah ve lóóm rââm, kung kah ve Yaang Pleng dhiq hóng katiêk ađô. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Bơơi, kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, adhi anó, nôôq manưih bhêêl n'loom biêh changaai bhayah, xók ađôk ơi bâân đââng tơk đan ve ahaam ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Taai chênh Ađó nek rau khe liêm ưng nôôq he. Nek Yaang ơi têêng đóng miq bơơr xar vaaih mưi lơq rơh pahư jađơr ưng rau targeet tarblah, hơq nek rau têêng brau, kalóóng achak araang Ađó, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Xók ơi m'peq lơơi gani ưng nôôq gani pachóóm kalóóng nôôq dhanang, buôn đóng Ađó ve chóóm têêng miq bơơr val xar mưi manưih tame kalóóng Ađó, tavaaih khe liêm, <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />lơq lơơi Ađó ve chóóm paliêm lóóm miq bơơr palơq Yaang Pleng kalóóng mưi achak araang tââq m'baang chatông, lơh xók leng kaxiêt tarlum têêng brau dhiq ađek. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Bhêêl Ađó ơi bhral, Ađó xêi truuih rau khe liêm đóng adhi anó, nek nôôq manưih tơơt changaai, lơq rau khe liêm đóng nôôq manưih tơơt đan, <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />taai ve Ađó, miq bơơr ve chóóm jađaang tơk đan kalóóng mưi Yaang Liêm đóng tơk palơq Ama. <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Kơi achêk hơq, adhi anó kah dyơq nek tamóói chrih dyơq môôiq manưih katiêk lââng. Klóóih dhiq ađek, adhi anó nek manưih matââq xưưq palơq nôôq manưih huuiq liêm lơq nek manưih kalóóng parlóng đong ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Taai ơi bâân têêng kadhơng dhiq bhanơn ưng nôôq sưưq-đô lơq nôôq đââng taruuih, xók chênh Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih nek dhơl n'tól đong, <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />hơq kalóóng Ađó, bhơt tarnêêng têêng kadhơng, xók bâân pater palơq xóng piđó, nek xar vaaih kơi mưi đong bhanuôih liêm kalóóng Chuôq, <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />lơq kung kalóóng Ađó, adhi anó bâân hayuur kadhơng madhiq palơq xóng ađêi xar dhiq jaq ưng Yaang Pleng kalóóng Yaang Liêm.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ơi taai kơi ađek, aku, Phaau-lô, nek manưih tơơt đong kanam ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi taai adhi anó dhanuôr katiêk lââng — <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />taai alua nek adhi anó ơi xâng leq tarnêêng jư lêi ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, nek rau ơi bâân pajaau đóng aku taai adhi anó, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />ting rau tapalêi ơi bâân pakah đóng aku, hơq nek rau kadrêi palââp kơi aku ơi xaraq kơi gađóq dhiq papiing. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Xók đok tơk rau achêk, adhi anó e ve chóóm bâân hei rau m'bưưiq n'nal ưng aku leq rau kadrêi lalââp ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />nek rau ơi kah bâân pakah đóng akóón anaaq akóón manưih kalóóng nôôq klaang manưih laloom, dhiq bhêêl xók đôk, tââq Yaang Liêm, rau achêk ơi bâân pakah đóng nôôq sưưq-đô huuiq liêm ưng Ađó palơq nôôq đââng taruuih — <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />ađek nek: nôôq dhanuôr lââng manưih makơi đơơp karvaan, nek nôôq dyung têi moh mat kalóóng mưi achak, lơq nek nôôq manưih kung blah nh'xóóng paraaq hươq kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih pakah tââq Taruuih Liêm, <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />taai Taruuih Liêm ađek hơq aku ơi bâân val kơi mưi dhơn ratơơq ganương dhiq kliim kaliim ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, nek rau ơi bâân đóng leq aku ting rau tarnêêng têêng ưng mataai raman Ađó. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ơơn phươk liêm achêk ơi bâân đóng leq aku, manưih parneq bhlơng kalóóng tabhơt nôôq manưih huuiq, đóng truuih pachóóm leq nôôq dhanuôr lââng rau karvaan kabhôôq kah bâân n'nal ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />lơq lơơi têêng brương braang đóng dyóp ngaai n'đó nek tarnêêng kadhâng akoq rau kadrêi palââp, nek rau ơi bâân kadrêi lââp vôôiq lơh nôôq klaang đơơi kalóóng Yaang Pleng, Yaang tavaaih dyóp n'dreh m'ma, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />buôn đóng xók đôk, tââq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq, rau tarbech galang dyóp kơi kiq vaaih ưng Yaang Pleng ve chóóm bâân pakah đóng nôôq takóh kadhâng akoq lơq nôôq manưih têêng kala tơơt nôôq dhiq m'piing pleng, <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />ting rau lóóm kiêng taluôn nh'chró đu Ađó ơi têêng xong kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he, <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />hơq kalóóng Yaang achêk, nôôq he ve lóóm grâ nhóól lơq kalơng vôôiq tơk đan Yaang Pleng lơq rau khin huuiq ve lóóm huuiq dhiq Ađó. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Kơi achêk hơq, aku nhan adhi anó óóq bha yuih lóóm taai nôôq hadhơơp jarnah ưng aku ơi taai adhi anó, hơq nôôq hadhơơp jarnah achêk nek rau cha-iil tabah ưng adhi anó.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ơi taai kơi ađek, aku chakoh takól toom mat Ama, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />nek Yaang đu tââq Ađó, dyóp kabhuh katooh m'piing pleng lơq n'raal katiêk bâân đóók achak, <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />đóng nhan Ađó, ting mơ rau karvaan kabhôôq ưng cha-iil tabah Ađó, têêng adhi anó bâân karơ gamak palơq raman mataai tââq Yaang Liêm ưng Ađó dhiq akóón manưih hót kalóóng, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />đóng Chuôq Paq Manưih tơơt jaq kalóóng lóóm adhi anó tarklóng tââq lóóm huuiq, xók ơi bâân mariêh lơq mưng bhanơn kalóóng lóóm tanhơr, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />buôn đóng adhi anó kung palơq tabhơt nôôq manưih huuiq liêm, ve dyóp praan đóng n'nal bhơt ng'kơi kiq nek bhươh, yaal kagan, yaal tadhơng, dhơuq, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />lơq đóng bâân n'nal rau jalơh lơh rau tarbech n'nal, chênh nek lóóm nh'nhơr ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, buôn đóng adhi anó bâân n'toh bing palơq dyóp rau bing dyóp ưng Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Nhan malóóm leq Yaang ve chóóm têêng jalơh lơh dyóp rau đu nôôq he gavơh nhan hamôôiq kanóq, ting mataai raman dyơq matêêng kalóóng nôôq he, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Nhan Yaang Pleng bâân cha-iil tabah kalóóng Akóón Dhơn Chuôq lơq kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih vôôiq lơh dyóp klaang manưih nh'chró kah bil. A-meen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Kơi achêk hơq, aku, manưih takról kalóóng Chuôq, mââl yua adhi anó phaai mamông kơi đu đaang palơq rau dhaloong yua đu adhi anó ơi bâân dhaloong tơk; <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Palơq tabhơt rau pakatưưiq lóóm lơq moor dha-iiq, kung palơq lóóm đuôh jruôn, đơơp maniin palơq xóng ađêi kalóóng lóóm tanhơr. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Phaai raan tabhơt praan đóng jư rau markơi lóóm ưng Yaang Liêm kalóóng pajum patoom makơi luônh lóóm. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Chapiên mưi achak araang lơq mưi Yaang Liêm, kung kơi adhi anó ơi bâân dhaloong tơk mưi lóóm rââm kalóóng rau dhaloong yua ưng ađêi, <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />chapiên mưi Chuôq, mưi lóóm huuiq, mưi pheep bap-teem; <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />chapiên mưi Yaang Pleng, Ama ưng dyóp ngaai, Yaang tơơt papiing dyóp ngaai, lơh dyóp ngaai lơq kalóóng dyóp ngaai. <verse eid="EPH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Bơơi ơơn phươk liêm ơi bâân đóng leq ting mưi chanak nôôq he ting mơ dhanang kalóóng rau pađơơp đóng ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Kơi ađek, ve paraaq xaraq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Xók Ađó dyók leq nôôq dhiq yaal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">Ađó vôôiq laloom ting đââng tanóói manưih takról,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">lơq đóng bơk kliim kaliim leq akóón manưih.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Dhơ kơi ađek: “Ađó yuur dyók” nek harau kiêng móón la eh rau nek Ađó kung ơi dhaluônh tơk nôôq dhiq êêp ưng katiêk? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Chênh Yaang ơi dhaluônh kung nek Yaang ơi dyók leq yaal lơh tabhơt nôôq klaang pleng, đóng Ađó ve chóóm têêng bing bhlaai dyóp rau. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Chênh Ađó ơi patơơt masôôq têêng sưưq-đô, masôôq têêng manưih đââng taruuih Yaang Pleng, masôôq manưih têêng truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm, masôôq têêng Muk sư lơq manưih pachóóm, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />đóng đââng tơk rau ravang pasam nôôq manưih huuiq liêm đóng tarnêêng têêng yaauq, malóóm tơk rau tavaaih hayuur achak araang ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />đóng patơk xók tabhơt nôôq he bâân tơk rau makơi lóóm kalóóng lóóm huuiq lơq rau dyóp n'nal Akóón Yaang Pleng, xar kơi manưih gamak taha, bâân tơk dhanang dyaang bhơt liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />đóng nôôq he yươq dyơq nek akóón paniên, bâân dhalươq dhaxươk lơq pajươk kamôôi ting dyóp ploong adhiiq hok taruuih tââq huông hư ưng palââng ve lóóm tabâân mangê palơq rau galơơk chachââr, môôp lơt. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Klóóih dhiq ađek, xók praaq pagluh paraaq dhalam kalóóng lóóm tanhơr, nôôq he ve chóóm grơơt tahayuur dhiq dyóp rauriq malóóm tơk Ađó, Yaang nek akoq, hơq nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />patư tââq Ađó hơq bhơt achak araang bâân pajum lóóiq lơq patoom xóng piđó ve dyóp tahaal chauq dyring poor jóói, ting kơi mơ đuôh têêng vôôiq dhiq dyóp beq dhiq achak, têêng đóng achak araang grơơt gamak đóng tư têêng hayuur kalóóng lóóm tanhơr.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Taai kơi ađek, aku praaq rau ađô lơq yua chut adhi anó kalóóng Chuôq, đóng kah dyơq cha tơơt thê kơi dhanuôr lââng dyơq, piđó mamông kalóóng rau kah matich ưng lóóm kanóq ađêi, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Taai lóóm kanóq piđó ơi bâân têêng đóng kanam kanheet, xar kơi changaai chrih palơq rau mamông ưng Yaang Pleng tââq rau ngôôk khơl tơơt kalóóng piđó, tââq lóóm piđó nhâng nhóóng. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Xók xar kơi kah n'nal kah đươi, piđó ơi patui ađêi mót rau bhuui sương đóng têêng dyóp rau anhuq palơq lóóm malóóch n'thaam. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Bơơi adhi anó ơi kah hok n'nal Chuôq Paq Manưih kơi achêk, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />taai alua nek adhi anó ơi xâng leq Ađó lơq ơi bâân pachóóm kalóóng Chuôq, ting kơi paraaq dhalam tơơt kalóóng Chuôq Jê-su, <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />kơi phaai lôh m'peq tââq adhi anó nôôq rau pâng leq kalơng mamông n'loom ahei, hơq nek akóón manưih ti bâân chêt bil taai lóóm malóóch kiêng galơơk chachââr, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />hơq bâân têêng vaaih tame ve Yaang liêm kalóóng lóóm karnóq ađêi; <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />lơq pei xơp akóón manưih tame, nek manưih bâân yuur tavaaih kơi Yaang Pleng, kalóóng rau bhơt liêm lơq rau sek tabah ưng paraaq dhalam.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Kơi achêk hơq, xók ơi m'peq lơơi rau galơơk chachââr; dyóp ngaai phaai praaq rau lalua dhalam palơq manưih dharing tapóóng ađêi, ơi taai nôôq he nek dyung, têi, moh, mat ưng xóng ađêi. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Adhi anó bâân yuur pagrâ hơq yươq têêng lơt. Phaai lơơi mat tangêi kah xriêp dhiq rau ơơr jar-ââih adhi anó, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />kung óóq tavaaih ve bhêêl đóng abhưi abhóch. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Manưih tatông papei óóq tatông papei dyơq. Bơơi liêm lơh, manưih achêk phaai tabhơt praan têêng tarnêêng liêm kre palơq chênh bơơr têi ađêi, buôn đóng manưih achêk ve đóng blah nh'xóóng palơq ngaai nôôq dyơq tơơt kalóóng ganah tabhuch tapiêl. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Óóq đóng paraaq praaq anhuq n'đó pađóh gluh tââq bóóp adhi anó, hơq phaai praaq nôôq paraaq n'đó kre liêm kanóq tơk rau têêng payuur ngaai manưih kalóóng ganah kadhaap kara, đóng paraaq achêk ve chóóm đââng ơơn liêm đóng manưih xâng. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Lơq óóq têêng ranguôq Chuôq Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, taai Ađó hơq adhi anó bâân tabóq karnal đóng tangêi trôông paq. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Phaai m'peq lơơi tââq adhi anó tabhơt ahaaq atang, grâ jar-ââih, môôp lóóm, tarkaai tarlak, praaq tamôôp, palơq dyóp rau lơt aak. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Klóóih dhiq ađek, phaai pakah đóng xóng ađêi lóóm moor dha-iiq, ayô ka-er, lơơi lơt xóng ađêi kung kơi Yaang Pleng ơi lơơi lơt adhi anó kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Kơi achêk phaai val kơi nôôq manưih ting tađuui Yaang Pleng, kơi akóón anaaq lóng bâân nh'nhơr liêm ưng Ađó, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />lơq phaai mamông kalóóng lóóm tanhơr, kung kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi nh'nhơr nôôq he lơq chênh Ađó đơơp chêt taai nôôq he kơi mưi rau bhanuôih lơq adhah bhuôih palơq barbưưih n'naq thum tapôông leq Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Dyơq rau têêng taniêt, palơq dyóp rau kah liêm môôiq n'thaam nek patơk mơ óóq bâân pahei tơk dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, kơi rau achêk nek targlap palơq nôôq manưih huuiq liêm. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kung óóq praaq paraaq tataaiq, paraaq papóh, môôiq praaq bharlưưk bablôônh, nek nôôq rau kah targlap, hơq klóóih dhiq ađek palơq paraaq ma-ơơn. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Alua kơi achêk, phaai n'nal rau ađôk đóng mưng dhakơi nek dyóp manưih têêng taniêt, kah liêm môôiq n'thaam, hơq nek manưih bhuôih kabhêi, maar kah ve drươp karvaan kalóóng katiêk karuung ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih lơq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Óóq đóng ngaai galơơk chachââr adhi anó palơq nôôq bóóp paraaq kah machak maraang, taai tââq nôôq rau achêk, ganơt pagrâ janah ưng Yaang Pleng n'toh leq dhiq nôôq akóón anaaq kah huuiq bóóp. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Đóng hơq, adhi anó óóq xar kơi nôôq manưih ting tapâng palơq piđó, <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />taai n'loom ahei adhi anó dyơq kanam kanheet, bơơi ađôk nek taklaaq brương kalóóng Chuôq. Phaai cha tơơt kơi akóón anaaq ưng rau brương <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />(taai pô pale ưng rau brương tơơt m'pơng dyóp rau liêm kre, bhơt liêm, lơq alua dhalam), <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />xók chagơn giit chamet lêi n'đó nek rau liêm lóóm Chuôq. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Óóq ting tapâng leq nôôq tarnêêng kah malơơi malaai ưng rau kanam kanheet, bơơi phaai gluh pakah piđó pâng lơh, <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />ơi alua nek kachiit mat xók chapiên pahei tơk nôôq tarnêêng piđó pei têêng kơi kadrêi lalââp. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Bơơi dyóp rau bâân lêi drêh xók bâân pakah taai kalaaq brương, taai dyóp rau bâân lêi drêh maar nek kalaaq brương. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Taai kơi ađek, ve paraaq praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Phaai taach mat yuur, ơơi manưih dyơq bêch,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">phaai yuur pađâh tââq kalóóng kabhuh manưih chêt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Chuôq Paq Manưih nek dyóól tabrương amei.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Kơi achêk hơq, phaai đương lêi chagơn kơi adhi anó dyơq cha tơơt; óóq kơi manưih ngôôk ngaak, bơơi kơi manưih tabech galang, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />xók kapươk vech tangêi kaxe, taai nôôq tangêi nek môôp. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Taai kơi achêk, óóq xar kơi manưih ngôôk ngaak, bơơi phaai n'nal n'đó nek karnóq kiêng ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Óóq ból buôh, taai rau ađek nek huông hư. Palâh lóóiq, phaai bâân bing bhlaai palơq Yaang Liêm, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />tar-ââi palơq xóng ađêi palơq chachơp, bha-aar haanh lơq guôp babóóch parhei, palơq kalóóng lóóm ađêi babóóch chaxuul lơq bhi haanh Chuôq, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />tapôông paraaq ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng, nek Ama, kalóóng dyóp bhêêl leq dyóp rau vơn dhanóók Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he, <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />lơq huuiq bóóp xóng ađêi kalóóng rau bhi kakhin Chuôq Paq Manưih —<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Manưih têêng kađiêl, phaai huuiq bóóp kayiik ađêi kơi huuiq bóóp Chuôq. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Taai kayiik nek akoq kađiêl, kung kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih nek akoq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq, chênh Ađó nek Chuôq paq ưng achak araang. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Akóón Dhơn Chuôq huuiq bóóp Chuôq Paq Manưih ng'kơi, nek kađiêl kung phaai huuiq bóóp kayiik ađêi kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng kơi achêk. <verse eid="EPH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Manưih têêng kayiik, phaai nh'nhơr kađiêl ađêi, kung kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi nh'nhơr Akóón Dhơn Chuôq lơq đơơp chêt chênh ađêi taai Akóón Dhơn Chuôq; <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />đóng Ađó ve chóóm paxar liêm kabhuh achêk, lơh xók têêng đóng sek tabah palơq kajut raau ưng đơơk kung palơq paraaq dhalam, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />buôn đóng Ađó đââng pakah mat đóng chênh Ađêi mưi Akóón Dhơn Chuôq cha-iil tabah, kah ve madhôôn bhrơuq môôiq garnhoq gartong, hamôôiq dhơ dharau haurau kơi achêk, bơơi đóng Akóón Dhơn Chuôq bâân sek tabah lơq kah dhiq jươm trêh. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Ting dharing kơi achêk nek kayiik kung phaai nh'nhơr kađiêl ađêi kơi chênh achak ađêi. Manưih kayiik nh'nhơr kađiêl ưng ađêi nek nh'nhơr chênh ađêi. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Taai yươq ngaai geet achak ađêi glêh mơ, bơơi ban paar lơq gamang lêi ađó, kung dhiêp kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih palơq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />taai nôôq he nek nôôq dyung, têi, moh, mat ưng achak araang Chuôq. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“Ơi taai ađek, manưih padruuih nek lơơi akonh kan lơq e bâân tơơt madhiq palơq kađiêl ađêi, miq bơơr e xar kơi mưi achak.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Rau lalââp hanua ađôk alua gamak bhlơng, bơơi aku dyơq praaq leq Chuôq Paq Manưih lơq leq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Dhơ kơi achêk, adhi anó kung ting kơi ađek ting chanak mưi, dyóp manưih kayiik phaai nh'nhơr kađiêl ađêi, kơi chênh ađêi, dyơq manưih kađiêl achêk nek chóóm bhi chap kayiik ađêi.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Manưih têêng akóón, phaai xâng bóóp akonh kan ưng nôôq akóón kalóóng Chuôq, taai ađek nek rau alua dhalam. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Phaai bhi chap akonh kan ưng akóón,” ađek nek gani pachóóm laloom ting lơq paraaq hươq: <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“đóng phươk liêm tơk leq akóón lơq akóón ve chóóm bâân mamông đươnh dhiq katiêk.” <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Manưih têêng akonh óóq ơơr garâ akóón anaaq ađêi. Klóóih dhiq ađek, phaai ban paar piđó kalóóng rau klôôq padheep lơq pató pachóóm ưng Chuôq.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Manưih têêng dhơn, phaai huuiq bóóp manưih kala ting phơn manưih ti palơq rau bhi chap lơq hayer kakhin dhiq lóóm lalua dhalam ưng ađêi thê kơi palơq Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />eh rau palơq kơi têêng yaauq xók kala chamet lêi kơi nôôq manưih kiêng pei lóóm, bơơi kơi dhơn ratơơq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, phaai têêng karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng palơq bhơt lóóm karnóq, <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />huuiq xâng palơq lóóm kiêng têêng, kơi têêng yaauq đóng Chuôq hơq eh rau đóng palââng, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Taai n'nal kơi dyóp manưih, dhơ têêng xól môôiq rathaai, la têêng tarnêêng liêm n'đó, hơq manưih achêk e đơơp rau markơi tư tââq Chuôq.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Lơq, manưih têêng kala, phaai praaq têêng dhalam kơi ađek palơq nôôq dhơn ratơơq, xók parngau tarnêêng grươl teng, taai n'nal kơi Manưih Kala lơq ưng ađó lơq ưng adhi anó dyơq tơơt dhiq pleng, lơq kah ve paq katơq dhiq Ađó.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Tatun xariêq, phaai bâân têêng đóng karơ gamak kalóóng Chuôq, lơq kalóóng praan karơ mataai raman ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Phaai pei xơp tabhơt gróh linh ưng Yaang Pleng, buôn têêng đóng adhi anó ve chóóm dyương mưng, jaklâk lóóiq nôôq karnóq mangê ưng abhưi abhóch. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Taai ganah tarvei tarjơl ưng nôôq he eh rau nek tarjơl palơq ahaam lơq ng'kar m'bech, bơơi nek tarjơl lóóiq nôôq têêng kala, tarjơl lóóiq nôôq takóh têêng gamak, tarjơl lóóiq nôôq kabhuh kadhâng koq hóng katiêk kanam kanheet ađô, tarjơl lóóiq nôôq yaang môôp tơơt nôôq dhiq m'piing pleng. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ơi taai ađek, phaai pei xơp tabhơt gróh linh ưng Yaang Pleng, đóng adhi anó ve chóóm tajơl taklót kalóóng tangêi tarleng, lơq dyương mưng lơh xók xong bhơt dyóp rau. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Kơi achêk hơq, phaai dyương tamưng, xók xeet talêi xaneet ưng adhi anó palơq paraaq dhalam, pei xơp aau gróh ưng rau bhơt liêm, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />xruk leq dyung rau ơi ravang ưng Taruuih Liêm yươq rauha, <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />tanôông payaal gahêêl gamak ưng lóóm huuiq kalóóng dyóp rau, taai ađek hơq adhi anó e ve chóóm m'bhrah tapat dyóp charah óih ưng manưih aak. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Phaai vech panơơng gróh trôông paq lơq bhươt Yaang Liêm, hơq nek paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />xók gavơh nhan dyóp bhêêl kalóóng Yaang Liêm pakah dyóp paraaq gavơh nhan lơq nhan panhel, lơq kanóq tơk machak maraang dhiq xók meh lóóm palơq tabhơt rau đuôh jruôn lơq rau gavơh nhan pakoom đóng tabhơt nôôq manưih huuiq liêm, <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />lơq koom đóng aku, đóng taruuih liêm ve chóóm bâân đóng leq aku, kalóóng tarnêêng pơơh bóóp ưng aku palơq rau nhóól grâ, đóng praaq pakah rau hanua palââp ưng Taruuih Liêm <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />(taai Taruuih Liêm achêk hơq aku vaaih xar manưih đââng taruuih dhiq m'pơng hadhơơp jarnah), buôn đóng kalóóng jarnah hadhơơp ađek, aku ve chóóm nhóól grâ truuih pachóóm ting kơi paraaq aku phaai praaq.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Bơơi đóng adhi anó kung ve chóóm n'nal nôôq chiên pâng tơk aku, aku dyơq têêng haurau, nek Ti-chi-kơ, manưih adhi anó bơk nh'nhơr lơq dhơn ratơơq bhơt lóóm kalóóng Chuôq, e đóng adhi anó n'nal dyóp chiên, <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />ađó chêk nek manưih hơq aku ơi yua tơk leq adhi anó taai tarnêêng ađôk, đóng adhi anó ve chóóm n'nal kakơi leq nôôq yi lơq lóóm adhi anó bâân tabhơơl.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Nhan yươq rauha đóng leq adhi anó, kung palơq lóóm tanhơr lơq lóóm huuiq tââq Yaang Pleng, nek Ama lơq Chuôq, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Nhan phươk liêm tơơt palơq tabhơt nôôq manưih nh'nhơr liêm Jê-su Chuôq paq manưih, Chuôq nôôq he, palơq lóóm tanhơr kah bil.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>